  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 202.01 Quorum. A quorum of the board shall be a simple majority of the total number of members.\n\nSource. #4549, eff 1-1-89; ss by #4730, eff 1-15-90; ss by #4898, eff 8-13-90; EXPIRED: 8-13-96\n\nNew. #6327, INTERIM, eff 8-24-96, EXPIRED: 12-22-96\n\nNew. #6449, eff 1-29-97; ss by #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9178-A, eff 6-13-08",
